{"question_id":"P006","question":"工程师申请 PRD 临时访问需要哪些审批和关联单据？最长多久，批准后设备不合规还可以执行吗？","split":"dev","question_type":"policy","answerable":true,"expected_sources":[{"source":"sample_data/knowledge_base/06-engineering-access.md","version":"1.9"}],"expected_answer_points":["关联变更单或P1/P2事件单。","直属经理与当班服务负责人双重批准，最长2小时。","受管设备、VPN和堡垒入口要求仍须满足；批准后权限撤销或设备不合规应拒绝。"],"allowed_user_ids":["u_engineer_001"],"source_spans":[{"source":"sample_data/knowledge_base/06-engineering-access.md","version":"1.9","start_char":241,"end_char":260,"text_hash":"974bbf33fe5ab7e24c0d8972bae4a1cc9265e2e4bf99f215893d2a2a5b9c5d08","parser_version":"utf8-structure-v1:md"},{"source":"sample_data/knowledge_base/06-engineering-access.md","version":"1.9","start_char":263,"end_char":280,"text_hash":"974bbf33fe5ab7e24c0d8972bae4a1cc9265e2e4bf99f215893d2a2a5b9c5d08","parser_version":"utf8-structure-v1:md"},{"source":"sample_data/knowledge_base/06-engineering-access.md","version":"1.9","start_char":283,"end_char":300,"text_hash":"974bbf33fe5ab7e24c0d8972bae4a1cc9265e2e4bf99f215893d2a2a5b9c5d08","parser_version":"utf8-structure-v1:md"},{"source":"sample_data/knowledge_base/06-engineering-access.md","version":"1.9","start_char":381,"end_char":409,"text_hash":"974bbf33fe5ab7e24c0d8972bae4a1cc9265e2e4bf99f215893d2a2a5b9c5d08","parser_version":"utf8-structure-v1:md"}]}
{"question_id":"X001","question":"GNOME 密码指南建议定期更改密码，这是否意味着公司 OneGate 也必须定期强制更换？如果怀疑 OneGate 密码泄露呢？","split":"dev","question_type":"cross_document","answerable":true,"expected_sources":[{"source":"gnome-user-goodpassword.md","version":"enterprise-zh-2026-10-16-v1"},{"source":"sample_data/knowledge_base/02-account-sso-mfa.md","version":"3.1"}],"expected_answer_points":["区分GNOME本机通用建议与OneGate具体政策。","OneGate不要求周期性强制更换；怀疑泄露时必须更换。","不能将通用桌面建议覆盖公司身份策略。"],"allowed_user_ids":["u_engineer_001"],"source_spans":[{"source":"gnome-user-goodpassword.md","version":"enterprise-zh-2026-10-16-v1","start_char":808,"end_char":815,"text_hash":"9dfef2be5cd069fd92354e7718e5c461dce2599a48876c912f0edd1285fe8dac","parser_version":"utf8-structure-v1:md"},{"source":"sample_data/knowledge_base/02-account-sso-mfa.md","version":"3.1","start_char":243,"end_char":280,"text_hash":"98f579912f3ae09fe90fc2e6a635dec4758b2310da80155b6ec38818d650fe39","parser_version":"utf8-structure-v1:md"}]}
